<title>CHINA: Jinqiao Export '96 net surges 75 pct.</title>
<headline>Jinqiao Export '96 net surges 75 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of yuan unless stated, against 1995 figures)</p>
<p> Turnover		  593.186	  vs	    516.364</p>
<p> Net profit		102.165	  vs	    58.275</p>
<p> Net asset per share     2.29  yuan   vs	2.16 yuan</p>
<p> Earnings per share	0.233 yuan   vs	0.218 yuan</p>
<p>Company name: Shanghai Jinqiao Export Processing Zone Development Co</p>
<p>Note: the figures were published in a company statement on Thursday. The net profit numbers are based on international accounting standards, other figures are based on domestic accounting standards.</p>
<p>According to domestic accounting standards, the 1996 net after-tax profit was 113.466 million yuan against 106.473 million yuan in 1995.</p>
</text>
